t="page">繁體中文</a><a hreflang="en" lang="en" href="kumihan-zh-han.en.html">English</a><a hreflang="ja" lang="ja" href="kumihan-zh-han.ja.html">日本語</a></nav></div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main id="main" tabindex="-1">\n<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">\n  <div class="shell hero-layout">\n    <div class="hero-copy">\n      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="line" aria-hidden="true"></span> OPEN SOURCE / TRADITIONAL CHINESE TYPOGRAPHY</p>\n      <!-- edition-version:hero --><div class="edition-version" lang="zh-Hant-TW" data-edition-version="hero" data-release-status="unpublished" dir="ltr"><strong>原始碼 <bdi dir="ltr">v0.1.0</bdi></strong><span>Release 尚未公開 — 尚無正式公開 ZIP 可供下載</span></div><!-- /edition-version:hero --><h1 id="hero-title">繁體中文排版<br><span class="accent">讓閱讀更自然</span></h1>\n      <p class="hero-desc">KUMIHAN｜字衡是一套開放原始碼 AI 技能，協助規劃、製作與檢視繁體中文網頁、文章、報告及簡報。依臺灣與香港的文字慣例做出有依據的判斷，同時尊重原稿與內容。</p>\n      <div class="hero-cta">\n        <a class="button button-primary" href="#install">開始安裝<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>\n        <a class="button" href="#concept">認識字衡<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class="hero-foot"><span>OPEN SOURCE</span><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>FOUR SKILLS</span><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>臺灣 zh-Hant-TW ／ 香港 zh-Hant-HK</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="hero-stage" aria-label="KUMIHAN official logo">\n      <div class="logo-card"><img src="assets/KUMIHAN_OFFICIAL_LOGO_MASTER_20261014.png" width="1254" height="1254" alt="KUMIHAN official logo" fetchpriority="high"></div>\n      <div class="stage-label"><span lang="zh-Hant-TW">閱讀</span> — <span>香港：先確認編輯體例</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="intro-strip" id="concept" aria-labelledby="concept-title">\n  <div class="shell intro-layout">\n    <div><span class="section-number">01 / THE IDEA</span></div>\n    <div class="intro-text"><h2 id="concept-title">不是把文字套進模板<br><em>而是為內容找到合適的位置</em></h2><p>字衡把文字組版視為內容設計的一部分。先確認讀者、媒體與地區，再判斷字體、標點、行距、斷行與資訊層次。它不強制所有設計採用同一套字型或固定版型。</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="features" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">\n  <div class="shell">\n    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-number">02 / WHAT MATTERS</div><h2 id="features-title">閱讀體驗從細節建立</h2></div><p>文字安排要有依據，也要留給設計判斷空間。</p></div>\n    <div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature"><div class="feature-index">01 / REGION</div><div class="feature-motif" aria-hidden="true">「」</div><h3>分別理解臺灣與香港</h3><p>標點、引號、字形與壓縮慣例依地區與機構體例判斷；不把臺灣的設定當作香港的唯一標準。</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="feature-index">02 / SOURCE</div><div class="feature-motif" aria-hidden="true">臺 / 港</div><h3>完整保留原稿</h3><p>姓名、商品名稱、價格、網址、異體字及 Unicode 序列不會為了版面被擅自替換或正規化。</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="feature-index">03 / LAYOUT</div><div class="feature-motif" aria-hidden="true">Aa 字</div><h3>配合內容設計版面</h3><p>按讀者、媒體、層次與實際顯示條件調整版面，而不是套用固定字型配方或同一種卡片模板。</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="feature-index">04 / REVIEW</div><div class="feature-motif" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><h3>以證據進行唯讀檢視</h3><p>將靜態候選、實際描畫證據及尚未檢查的項目分別記錄；審閱不直接修改作品。</p></article></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="idea-band" id="regions" aria-labelledby="idea-title">\n  <div class="shell idea-layout locale-layout">\n    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="line" aria-hidden="true"></span> TAIWAN / HONG KONG</p><h2 id="idea-title">同是繁體中文<br>地區脈絡不同</h2><p>兩個地區皆保留輸入字元；真正的行端、區域字形及縮放表現應以實際環境檢查。</p></div>\n    <div class="locale-cards"><article lang="zh-Hant-TW"><div class="locale-tag"><span lang="en">TW</span><strong lang="zh-Hant-TW">臺灣</strong></div><code lang="en">zh-Hant-TW</code><p lang="zh-Hant-TW">新寫正文可從「」與『』的引號體例開始，但須尊重原稿及編輯要求；排版壓縮不是強制規則。</p></article><article lang="zh-Hant-HK"><div class="locale-tag"><span lang="en">HK</span><strong lang="zh-Hant-TW">香港</strong></div><code lang="en">zh-Hant-HK</code><p lang="zh-Hant-TW">引號、標點和字形須先確認出版社、機構或專案體例。不預設套用臺灣的教育規範。</p></article></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="skills-section" id="skills" aria-labelledby="skills-title">\n  <div class="shell">\n    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-number">03 / THE SKILLS</div><h2 id="skills-title">四個獨立技能各司其職</h2></div><p>每個技能都帶有自己的規則、參考文件與來源，不需先安裝日文版 KUMIHAN。</p></div>\n    <div class="skills-grid"><a class="skill-card" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/skills/kumihan-ziheng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="card-top"><span class="skill-type">01 / ENTRY</span><span class="skill-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◆</span></div><div><h3 class="skill-name">kumihan-ziheng</h3><p class="skill-desc">工作入口與範圍 — 先選擇地區、媒體與工作模式，確定可以改動的範圍。</p><div class="skill-end"><span>查看技能</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></a><a class="skill-card" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/skills/kumihan-ziheng-web" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="card-top"><span class="skill-type">02 / WEB</span><span class="skill-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</span></div><div><h3 class="skill-name">kumihan-ziheng-web</h3><p class="skill-desc">網頁、文章與介面 — 處理內容結構、語言標示、換行與不同螢幕寬度。</p><div class="skill-end"><span>查看技能</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></a><a class="skill-card" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/skills/kumihan-ziheng-documents" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="card-top"><span class="skill-type">03 / DOCUMENTS</span><span class="skill-symbol" aria-hidden="true">版</span></div><div><h3 class="skill-name">kumihan-ziheng-documents</h3><p class="skill-desc">文件、報告與簡報 — 規劃資訊層級與可閱讀的文件、投影片及輸出檢查。</p><div class="skill-end"><span>查看技能</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></a><a class="skill-card" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/skills/kumihan-ziheng-review" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="card-top"><span class="skill-type">04 / REVIEW</span><span class="skill-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div><div><h3 class="skill-name">kumihan-ziheng-review</h3><p class="skill-desc">唯讀排版審閱 — 列出問題及證據，不修改原始內容；未實測的項目如實標記。</p><div class="skill-end"><span>查看技能</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="install-section" id="install" aria-labelledby="install-title"><!-- edition-version:install --><div class="edition-version" lang="zh-Hant-TW" data-edition-version="install" data-release-status="unpublished" dir="ltr"><strong>原始碼 <bdi dir="ltr">v0.1.0</bdi></strong><span>Release 尚未公開 — 尚無正式公開 ZIP 可供下載</span></div><!-- /edition-version:install -->\n  <div class="shell install-layout">\n    <div class="install-intro"><div class="section-number">04 / GET STARTED</div><h2 id="install-title">從熟悉的 AI 工具開始</h2><p>使用獨立 ZIP 安裝完整插件或單一技能；實際步驟依 ChatGPT／Codex 的可用功能而異。</p></div>\n    <div><div class="install-links"><a class="platform-row" href="docs/install-ziheng.html"><span class="platform-index">01</span><div class="platform-info"><div class="platform-name">ChatGPT / Codex</div><div class="platform-note">完整插件 ZIP 與單一技能的安裝指南</div></div><span class="platform-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="platform-row" href="docs/install-ziheng-claude.html"><span class="platform-index">02</span><div class="platform-info"><div class="platform-name">Claude / Claude Code</div><div class="platform-note">Claude Code 插件與 Claude 應用程式技能</div></div><span class="platform-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="platform-row" href="docs/install-ziheng-gemini.html"><span class="platform-index">03</span><div class="platform-info"><div class="platform-name">Gemini</div><div class="platform-note">Gemini CLI 擴充功能與技能</div></div><span class="platform-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="install-extra">也可以直接<a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/landco-llc/kumihan/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/plugins/kumihan-ziheng-0.1.0.zip" download>取得 ZIP<span lang="en"> (Source ZIP)</span></a>，或在 <a href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> 檢視原始碼。</div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="status-section" aria-labelledby="status-title">\n  <div class="shell status-box">\n    <div><div class="status-title" id="status-title">VERSION / v0.1.0</div><p><strong>清楚區分已驗證與尚未驗證的範圍</strong></p><p>字衡包含 15 條地區規則、16 條共通政策與四個技能。僅有部分靜態子功能可以用程式檢查；實際瀏覽器排版、Word／PDF 與各主機行為不可一概宣稱通過。 v0.2.0 原始碼候選新增語體、角色、原稿權限與證據契約。32個案例是驗證定義；尚未完成的描畫、操作及當地校閱分別記錄。共通版本顯示待整合，舊版下載仍保留。</p></div>\n    <div class="status-meta"><a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/landco-llc/kumihan/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/plugins/kumihan-ziheng-0.1.0.zip" download>取得 ZIP ↗<span lang="en"> (Source ZIP)</span></a><br>OPEN SOURCE · APACHE 2.0</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class="cta-section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">\n  <div class="shell cta-layout">\n    <div><h2 id="cta-title">用更慎重的方式對待每一行文字</h2><p>開放原始碼、可獨立導入，讓文字組版的判斷能夠檢查、說明與改進。</p></div>\n    <a class="button" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往 GitHub<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class="kumihan-footer"><div class="kf-inner"><div class="kf-brand"><div class="kf-mark">KUMIHAN</div><p class="kf-note">Open-source typography &amp; design guidance by <a href="https://landco.co.jp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">L&amp;Co. LLC</a>.</p></div><nav class="kf-links" aria-label="KUMIHAN"><a href="top-zh-han.html">KUMIHAN</a><details class="kf-menu"><summary>選擇語言</summary><ul><li><a href="kumihan-zh-han.html" class="current"><span class="code">ZH-HANT</span> - 繁體中文</a></li><li><a href="kumihan-ar.en.html"><span class="code">AR</span> - 阿拉伯文</a></li><li><a href="kumihan-bn.en.html"><sp