readcrumb"><a href="../top-zh-han.html">KUMIHAN 首頁</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="../kumihan-zh-han.html">KUMIHAN<span class="brand-rule">｜</span>字衡</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>安裝指南</span></nav>\n    <div class="hero-grid">\n      <div>\n        <div class="eyebrow">INSTALL GUIDE / 01 OF 03</div>\n        <h1 id="page-title">安裝 KUMIHAN｜字衡</h1>\n        <p class="hero-desc">選擇完整插件或獨立技能，驗證下載來源，並用臺灣與香港的小樣本確認行為。這是此版本，並非所有主機都提供相同的安裝功能。</p>\n        <nav class="language-switch lang-picker" aria-label="語言"><a href="install-ziheng.html" lang="zh-Hant-TW" hreflang="zh-Hant-TW" data-language aria-current="page">繁體中文</a><a href="install-ziheng.en.html" lang="en" hreflang="en" data-language>English</a><a href="install-ziheng.ja.html" lang="ja" hreflang="ja" data-language>日本語</a></nav>\n      </div>\n      <div class="hero-logo"><img src="../assets/KUMIHAN_OFFICIAL_LOGO_MASTER_20261014.png" alt="KUMIHAN official logo" width="1254" height="1254"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<nav class="platform-nav" aria-label="選擇 AI 平台">\n  <div class="shell platform-inner"><a href="install-ziheng.html" aria-current="page"><span>01 / ChatGPT / Codex</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="install-ziheng-claude.html"><span>02 / Claude</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="install-ziheng-gemini.html"><span>03 / Gemini</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>\n</nav>\n<div class="shell content-layout">\n  <aside class="toc" aria-label="本頁目錄"><!-- edition-version:current --><div class="edition-version" lang="zh-Hant-TW" data-edition-version="current" data-release-status="unpublished" dir="ltr"><strong>原始碼 <bdi dir="ltr">v0.1.0</bdi></strong><span>Release 尚未公開 — 尚無正式公開 ZIP 可供下載</span></div><!-- /edition-version:current -->\n    <details class="toc-details" open>\n      <summary>展開本頁目錄</summary>\n      <h2 class="toc-title">本頁目錄</h2>\n      <ol><li><a href="#options">依主機選擇適用方式</a></li><li><a href="#steps">分步安裝</a></li><li><a href="#download">ZIP 與 SHA-256</a></li><li><a href="#other-hosts">更多平台的安裝方式</a></li><li><a href="#verify">驗證與限制</a></li></ol>\n    </details>\n    <div class="toc-note"><strong>VERSION / v0.1.0</strong><p>這是此版本，原生主機的安裝與技能呼叫尚未驗收。部分操作可能無法在你的使用環境中執行。</p></div>\n    <a class="source-link" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看原始安裝說明 ↗</a>\n  </aside>\n  <main class="guide" id="main" tabindex="-1">\n    <div class="guide-head"><span>DOCUMENTATION / ChatGPT / Codex</span><span class="step-label">安裝步驟與注意事項</span></div>\n    <div class="guide-pane"><section class="install-section" id="options"><div class="section-kicker">01 / OPTIONS</div><h2>依主機選擇適用方式</h2><div class="option-grid"><article class="option-card"><div class="option-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▣</div><h3>完整插件 ZIP</h3><p>包含四個獨立技能及本地參考檔。僅能透過主機實際支援的插件匯入功能安裝；在 ChatGPT 對話直接上傳 ZIP 並不等於完成安裝。</p></article><article class="option-card"><div class="option-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</div><h3>單一 Skill ZIP</h3><p>也可只取得需要的技能。對支援本地 Skills 的 Codex，完整資料夾可放在專案的 .agents/skills/ 之下。</p></article><article class="option-card"><div class="option-symbol" aria-hidden="true">i</div><h3>公開狀態</h3><p>GitHub 已提供程式碼和預覽 ZIP；字衡並未宣稱已在公開插件商店完成上架。Claude／Gemini 已備有專用預覽 ZIP；實際主機呼叫仍須另外驗證。</p></article></div></section><section class="install-section install-steps" id="steps"><div class="section-kicker">02 / STEPS</div><h2>分步安裝</h2><div class="steps"><article class="step"><span class="step-index">01</span><div><h3>下載並核對來源</h3><p>從 KUMIHAN 正式 GitHub repository 取得完整 ZIP，對照 SHA256SUMS.txt。檔名包含版本，插件顯示名稱不包含版本。</p></div></article><article class="step"><span class="step-index">02</span><div><h3>選擇主機支援的安裝入口</h3><p>ChatGPT 的私人插件匯入需使用帳戶實際提供的插件功能；Codex 可使用相容的技能安裝入口。不要把 ZIP 當作普通附件就認為插件已啟用。</p></div></article><article class="step"><span class="step-index">03</span><div><h3>Codex 本地獨立技能</h3><p>解壓後，將需要的完整 kumihan-ziheng* 技能資料夾複製到專案 .agents/skills/；保留其 SKILL.md、references、rules、profiles、schemas 及其他檔案。請先備份同名資料夾。</p></div></article><article class="step"><span class="step-index">04</span><div><h3>用兩個地區的小樣本驗收</h3><p>在新對話中明示技能名與地區，檢查臺灣與香港規則是否分開、原稿是否原樣保留，以及唯讀審閱是否沒有改動檔案。</p></div></article></div></section><section class="download-panel" id="download"><div class="download-grid"><div><span class="section-kicker">03 / DOWNLOADS</span><h2>ZIP 與 SHA-256</h2><p>對完整插件 ZIP 的核對值。下載後可執行 sha256sum（或等效工具）比較；實際發行檔若改版，以當版的校驗清單為準。</p><div class="checksum"><span>下載檔案 SHA-256</span><code>6ad81765ece7d4fc37297e7ba62af767d94347c814e9432c7ee89e11162f6441</code></div></div><div class="downloads"><a class="download-row" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/landco-llc/kumihan/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/plugins/kumihan-ziheng-0.1.0.zip" download>下載完整 ZIP<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span><span lang="en"> (Source ZIP)</span></a><a class="download-row" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/blob/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/SHA256SUMS.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看校驗清單<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a><a class="download-row" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看四個單一技能 ZIP<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a><a class="download-row" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/blob/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/INSTALL.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">原始碼及更新說明<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a></div></div></section>\n<section class="install-section" id="other-hosts"><div class="section-kicker">04 / CLAUDE &amp; GEMINI</div><h2>更多平台的安裝方式</h2><div class="install-options"><a class="install-row" href="install-ziheng-claude.html">在 Claude 中安裝字衡<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="install-row" href="install-ziheng-gemini.html">在 Gemini 中安裝字衡<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="section-deck">臺灣與香港的規則分別對應 zh-Hant-TW、zh-Hant-HK。請明確指定地區並保留原稿。</p></section><section class="install-section" id="verify"><div class="section-kicker">05 / VERIFY</div><h2>驗證與限制</h2><div class="example-grid"><article><span class="locale-mini">TW / zh-Hant-TW</span><h3>臺灣</h3><blockquote>以 zh-Hant-TW 規劃這段文章的版面，保留原稿：「陳𠮷、臺／台、ＨＫ＄１２３」。未描畫的項目請標為 not-checked。</blockquote></article><article><span class="locale-mini">HK / zh-Hant-HK</span><h3>香港</h3><blockquote>以 zh-Hant-HK 唯讀檢視這段文字，保留引號及網址，先確認機構的編輯體例，不要自動套用臺灣引號規則。</blockquote></article></div>\n<aside class="limit-note"><h3>尚未驗證的項目</h3><p>這套插件是組版指引，不是自動渲染器。實際行末禁則、200% 原生縮放、區域字形、直排、注音、Word、PowerPoint 與 PDF，需在指定環境另外檢查。靜態候選不等於已修正的錯誤。</p></aside><div class="back-line"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="../kumihan-zh-han.html" >返回字衡首頁<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a></div></section></div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n<footer class="kumihan-footer"><div class="kf-inner"><div class="kf-brand"><div class="kf-mark">KUMIHAN</div><p class="kf-note">Open-source typography &amp; design guidance by <a href="https://landco.co.jp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">L&amp;Co. LLC</a>.</p></div><nav class="kf-links" aria-label="KUMIHAN"><a href="../top-zh-han.html">KUMIHAN</a><details class="kf-menu"><summary>選擇語言</summary><ul><li><a href="../kumihan-zh-han.html" class="current"><span class="code">ZH-HANT</span> - 繁體中文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-ar.en.html"><span class="code">AR</span> - 阿拉伯文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-bn.en.html"><span class="code">BN</span> - 孟加拉文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-de.en.html"><span class="code">DE</span> - 德文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-es.en.html"><span class="code">ES</span> - 西班牙文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-fa.en.html"><span class="code">FA</span> - 波斯文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-fr.en.html"><span class="code">FR</span> - 法文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-hi.en.html"><span class="code">HI</span> - 印地文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-id.en.html"><span class="code">ID</span> - 印尼文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-it.en.html"><span class="code">IT</span> - 義大利文</a></li><li><a href="../zh-tw.html"><span class="code">JA</span> - 日文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-km.en.html"><span class="code">KM</span> - 高棉文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-ko.en.html"><span class="code">KO</span> - 韓文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-pl.en.html"><span class="code">PL</span> - 波蘭文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-pt.en.html"><span class="code">PT</span> - 葡萄牙文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-ru.en.html"><span class="code">RU</span> - 俄文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-sw.en.html"><span class="code">SW</span> - 史瓦希利語</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-th-en.html"><span class="code">TH</span> - 泰文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-vi.en.html"><span class="code">VI</span> - 越南文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-zh-cn.en.html"><span class="code">ZH-HANS</span> - 簡體中文</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-zu.en.html"><span class="code">ZU</span> - 祖魯語</a></li></ul></details><a href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apache 2.0</a><a href="../privacy.html#zh-hant">隱私權政策</a></nav></div></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n'

