I platform">\n  <div class="shell platform-inner"><a href="install-ziheng.en.html" aria-current="page"><span>01 / ChatGPT / Codex</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="install-ziheng-claude.en.html"><span>02 / Claude</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="install-ziheng-gemini.en.html"><span>03 / Gemini</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>\n</nav>\n<div class="shell content-layout">\n  <aside class="toc" aria-label="On this page"><!-- edition-version:current --><div class="edition-version" lang="en" data-edition-version="current" data-release-status="unpublished" dir="ltr"><strong>Source <bdi dir="ltr">v0.1.0</bdi></strong><span>Release unpublished — Published ZIP downloads unavailable</span></div><!-- /edition-version:current -->\n    <details class="toc-details" open>\n      <summary>Show page contents</summary>\n      <h2 class="toc-title">On this page</h2>\n      <ol><li><a href="#options">Choose the method supported by your host</a></li><li><a href="#steps">Setup steps</a></li><li><a href="#download">ZIP and SHA-256</a></li><li><a href="#other-hosts">Other installation options</a></li><li><a href="#verify">Verify and limitations</a></li></ol>\n    </details>\n    <div class="toc-note"><strong>VERSION / v0.1.0</strong><p>This version has limited verification. Native host installation and skill invocation have not been accepted yet. Some steps may be unavailable in your environment.</p></div>\n    <a class="source-link" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source installation docs ↗</a>\n  </aside>\n  <main class="guide" id="main" tabindex="-1">\n    <div class="guide-head"><span>DOCUMENTATION / ChatGPT / Codex</span><span class="step-label">Steps &amp; guidance</span></div>\n    <div class="guide-pane"><section class="install-section" id="options"><div class="section-kicker">01 / OPTIONS</div><h2>Choose the method supported by your host</h2><div class="option-grid"><article class="option-card"><div class="option-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▣</div><h3>Full plugin ZIP</h3><p>Contains four standalone skills and local references. Import it only through a plugin workflow actually supported by the host. Uploading a ZIP as a normal ChatGPT attachment does not install a plugin.</p></article><article class="option-card"><div class="option-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</div><h3>Individual Skill ZIPs</h3><p>Install only the role you need. For Codex environments supporting local Skills, place the complete folder under your project’s .agents/skills/ directory.</p></article><article class="option-card"><div class="option-symbol" aria-hidden="true">i</div><h3>Publication status</h3><p>Source and preview archives are available on GitHub. ZiHeng is not claimed to be listed in the public plugin marketplace. Dedicated Claude/Gemini preview ZIPs are available; live host invocation still requires verification.</p></article></div></section><section class="install-section install-steps" id="steps"><div class="section-kicker">02 / STEPS</div><h2>Setup steps</h2><div class="steps"><article class="step"><span class="step-index">01</span><div><h3>Download and verify</h3><p>Get the complete ZIP from the official KUMIHAN repository and compare its SHA-256 with SHA256SUMS.txt. The filename is versioned; the plugin’s display name is not.</p></div></article><article class="step"><span class="step-index">02</span><div><h3>Use an installation entrypoint your host supports</h3><p>Private ChatGPT plugin import depends on your account’s available features; Codex may provide local Skills support. Simply attaching the ZIP to a chat does not activate it.</p></div></article><article class="step"><span class="step-index">03</span><div><h3>Standalone skills in Codex</h3><p>Extract the archive, then copy the complete kumihan-ziheng* skill folder(s) to .agents/skills/ in your project. Retain SKILL.md and its references, rules, profiles, schemas and other files. Back up any existing folder first.</p></div></article><article class="step"><span class="step-index">04</span><div><h3>Run Taiwan and Hong Kong samples</h3><p>Explicitly invoke the skill and locale in a new conversation. Check regional selection, exact source preservation and that read-only reviews do not modify the target.</p></div></article></div></section><section class="download-panel" id="download"><div class="download-grid"><div><span class="section-kicker">03 / DOWNLOADS</span><h2>ZIP and SHA-256</h2><p>Checksum for the complete plugin archive. Compare after downloading with sha256sum or an equivalent utility; for future versions use the matching release manifest.</p><div class="checksum"><span>Full plugin SHA-256</span><code>6ad81765ece7d4fc37297e7ba62af767d94347c814e9432c7ee89e11162f6441</code></div></div><div class="downloads"><a class="download-row" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/landco-llc/kumihan/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/plugins/kumihan-ziheng-0.1.0.zip" download>Download complete ZIP<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span><span lang="en"> (Source ZIP)</span></a><a class="download-row" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/blob/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/SHA256SUMS.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View checksums<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a><a class="download-row" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/tree/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/downloads/skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View four individual skill ZIPs<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a><a class="download-row" href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/blob/main/plugins/kumihan-ziheng/INSTALL.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source and update notes<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a></div></div></section>\n<section class="install-section" id="other-hosts"><div class="section-kicker">04 / CLAUDE &amp; GEMINI</div><h2>Other installation options</h2><div class="install-options"><a class="install-row" href="install-ziheng-claude.en.html">Install ZiHeng for Claude<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="install-row" href="install-ziheng-gemini.en.html">Install ZiHeng for Gemini<span class="external-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="section-deck">Taiwan and Hong Kong use explicit zh-Hant-TW and zh-Hant-HK profiles. Preserve the original characters.</p></section><section class="install-section" id="verify"><div class="section-kicker">05 / VERIFY</div><h2>Verify and limitations</h2><div class="example-grid"><article><span class="locale-mini">TW / zh-Hant-TW</span><h3>Taiwan</h3><blockquote>Plan this article for zh-Hant-TW without changing the source: 「陳𠮷、臺／台、ＨＫ＄１２３」. Mark checks without rendered evidence as not-checked.</blockquote></article><article><span class="locale-mini">HK / zh-Hant-HK</span><h3>Hong Kong</h3><blockquote>Review this text read-only for zh-Hant-HK. Keep its quotes and URLs; first establish the institution’s editorial conventions rather than applying Taiwan defaults.</blockquote></article></div>\n<aside class="limit-note"><h3>What is not automatically verified</h3><p>This is typography guidance, not a layout renderer. True line-edge behavior, native 200% zoom, regional glyph appearance, vertical writing, Bopomofo, Word, PowerPoint and PDF need separate checks in the actual target. A static finding is not an automatically corrected error.</p></aside><div class="back-line"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="../kumihan-zh-han.en.html" >Back to ZiHeng home<span aria-hidden="true" class="external-mark">↗</span></a></div></section></div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n<footer class="kumihan-footer"><div class="kf-inner"><div class="kf-brand"><div class="kf-mark">KUMIHAN</div><p class="kf-note">Open-source typography &amp; design guidance by <a href="https://landco.co.jp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">L&amp;Co. LLC</a>.</p></div><nav class="kf-links" aria-label="KUMIHAN"><a href="../index.html">KUMIHAN</a><details class="kf-menu"><summary>Choose a language</summary><ul><li><a href="../kumihan-ar.en.html"><span class="code">AR</span> - Arabic</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-bn.en.html"><span class="code">BN</span> - Bangla</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-de.en.html"><span class="code">DE</span> - German</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-es.en.html"><span class="code">ES</span> - Spanish</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-fa.en.html"><span class="code">FA</span> - Persian</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-fr.en.html"><span class="code">FR</span> - French</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-hi.en.html"><span class="code">HI</span> - Hindi</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-id.en.html"><span class="code">ID</span> - Indonesian</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-it.en.html"><span class="code">IT</span> - Italian</a></li><li><a href="../en.html"><span class="code">JA</span> - Japanese</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-km.en.html"><span class="code">KM</span> - Khmer</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-ko.en.html"><span class="code">KO</span> - Korean</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-pl.en.html"><span class="code">PL</span> - Polish</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-pt.en.html"><span class="code">PT</span> - Portuguese</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-ru.en.html"><span class="code">RU</span> - Russian</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-sw.en.html"><span class="code">SW</span> - Swahili</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-th-en.html"><span class="code">TH</span> - Thai</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-vi.en.html"><span class="code">VI</span> - Vietnamese</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-zh-cn.en.html"><span class="code">ZH-HANS</span> - Simplified Chinese</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-zh-han.en.html"><span class="code">ZH-HANT</span> - Traditional Chinese</a></li><li><a href="../kumihan-zu.en.html"><span class="code">ZU</span> - isiZulu</a></li></ul></details><a href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/landco-llc/kumihan/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apache 2.0</a><a href="../privacy.html#en">Privacy Policy</a></nav></div></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n'

